3. ABSOLUTE NON-NEGOTIABLE RULES
RULE A — NO SCAFFOLD RULE

Feature modules MUST NOT contain:

Scaffold
AppBar
Drawer
BottomNavigationBar

These belong ONLY in:

MainShell
DashboardShell
UnifiedDashboardHost

Modules render content only.

Never violate this.

RULE B — NEVER PASS user_id

Frontend must NEVER pass:

user_id
owner_id
ownership identifiers
security-sensitive identity fields

Identity must resolve server-side using:

core.auth_user_id()

with RLS enforcement.

This is mandatory.

No exceptions.

RULE C — UI NEVER TALKS DIRECTLY TO SUPABASE

Forbidden:

Widget → Supabase

Required:

Widget → Provider → Controller → Repository → Service → Backend

Strict architecture only.

No shortcuts.

RULE D — FULL FILE OUTPUT ONLY

AI must always return:

Full updated code
Exact file path
Registry updates
Integration explanation

Never return partial snippets unless explicitly requested.

RULE E — SCHEMA-FIRST DEVELOPMENT

Never invent fields.

Never guess backend structure.

Frontend must align to real backend schema.

Database schema is the source of truth.

Always.

