5. SELF-REGISTERING MODULE RULE

Every feature must include:

class ModuleNameModule extends AppModule

It must self-register:

routes
sidebar navigation
dashboard widgets
permissions
lazy loading
module metadata

No hardcoded navigation.

Registry-first architecture only.

6. UNIFIED DASHBOARD RULE

Never build isolated dashboards.

Modules must register widgets into:

UnifiedDashboardHost

Example:

DashboardWidgetConfig(
  id: 'farm_kpis',
  module: 'farm_management',
  builder: ...
)

Dashboard must be:

dynamic
role-aware
context-aware
registry-driven

Never static.

7. CONTEXT ENGINE RULE

All modules must resolve:

User
→ Entity
→ Business Context
→ Farm Context
→ Production Context

Examples:

current farm
selected business
cooperative access
delegated manager access

Never hardcode assumptions.

Always context-driven.

8. RIVERPOD PRODUCTION PATTERN

Mandatory:

UI
→ Provider
→ Controller
→ Repository
→ Service
→ Backend

Forbidden:

FutureBuilder architecture
direct repository calls inside widgets
business logic inside UI
fetches inside build()

Strict separation required.

9. PERFORMANCE PROTOCOL

Mandatory:

single-trip queries
no duplicate provider calls
pagination
lazy loading
registry caching
payload minimization
server-side KPI aggregation
no over-fetching
cache-first architecture
low-data usage for rural users

Performance is a product feature.

Not an optimization later.

10. STORAGE & MEDIA GOVERNANCE

Single bucket:

media/

Structured paths:

images/
videos/
documents/
thumbnails/

Rules:

max 3 images on free tier
videos restricted
client-side compression mandatory
server-side optimization mandatory
thumbnails-first loading
no raw client storage writes

Storage cost control is mandatory.

11. RESPONSIVE ROOT STRUCTURE

All pages must use responsive layout:

Container(
  width: double.infinity,
  padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 16),
  child: LayoutBuilder(
    builder: (context, constraints) {
      if (constraints.maxWidth < 600) {
        return buildMobile();
      }
      if (constraints.maxWidth < 1024) {
        return buildTablet();
      }
      return buildDesktop();
    },
  ),
)

No desktop-only assumptions.

